      "cooked": "<p>I was wondering if my play style would be different if I had all the odds in front of me as I played. So, I made up <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1dxYE8qziHwLRUZ0cQRqvT1UN4NQ1zjxjc1bP4lkNUos/edit#gid=448074065&amp;vpid=A1\">this sheet</a>. It's not perfect, and only has The Ennead and Voss for now, but as cards get played, it tells me the odds of different things happening. Any suggestions for an ability I missed or a particular villain this would help with?</p>",
